  "goodToKnow": "Der Henkel is a handle on a cup, jug, pot or basket: die Tasse am Henkel halten. Other handles have other words: die Türklinke (door handle), der Griff (grip, handle of a bag or tool), der Stiel (handle of a pan or broom). The word is related to hängen, since a Henkel is what you hang things by. Henkel is also a major Düsseldorf company that makes Persil, Pritt glue and Schwarzkopf. The plural is the same."
